      "fix": "Use React‑Native‑Paper’s BottomNavigation component with `accessibilityRole=\"tablist\"` on the container and `accessibilityRole=\"tab\"` on each tab button. Set `accessibilityState={{ selected: isFocused }}` and ensure a 2 px solid primary outline appears on focus."
